{"id":"9cb27886596a0452","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-prop-kurepa.md","title":"Kurepa Hypothesis Witness","display":"prop-kurepa — Kurepa Hypothesis Witness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-kurepa","aliases":["58-prop-kurepa"],"display":"prop-kurepa — Kurepa Hypothesis Witness","depends_on":["[[58-df-kurepa-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-kurepa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-kurepa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-kurepa — Kurepa Hypothesis Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8519e320aac8e03\" href=\"?note=a8519e320aac8e03\" title=\"58-df-kurepa-tree\">58-df-kurepa-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(T,R,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\)</span> is the exact ordered-tree predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> denotes the Kurepa hypothesis at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kurepa}\\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists T,R\\in V\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kurepa}\\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists T,R\\in V\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The former assertion about the absence of Suslin subtrees did not follow from the Kurepa hypothesis.</li>\n<li>This proposition records exactly the witness form of the hypothesis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-kurepa-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a8519e320aac8e03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-kurepa-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kurepa}\\vdash \\mathrm{KH}_S(\\kappa)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists T,R\\in V\\;\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa).","display":true}],"bytes":772,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3974","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-prop-kurepa.md|58-prop-kurepa]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a8519e320aac8e03"]}